ERROR:  function test_relundo_dump_chain(unknown) does not exist
LINE 1: SELECT count(*) AS t1_undo_count FROM test_relundo_dump_chai...
                                              ^
DETAIL:  There is no function of that name.
SELECT count(*) AS t2_undo_count FROM test_relundo_dump_chain('relundo_t2');
ERROR:  function test_relundo_dump_chain(unknown) does not exist
LINE 1: SELECT count(*) AS t2_undo_count FROM test_relundo_dump_chai...
                                              ^
DETAIL:  There is no function of that name.
-- They should not interfere with each other
SELECT * FROM relundo_t1 ORDER BY id;
ERROR:  relation "relundo_t1" does not exist
LINE 1: SELECT * FROM relundo_t1 ORDER BY id;
                      ^
